+ * NT world only the USB disks nothing of the host's is on, and describes them
+ * in /run/arctic/disks: each becomes \Device\HarddiskN\DR0, PhysicalDriveN and
+ * a device of the setup API, as USBSTOR would make it. Reads and writes go
+ * straight to the block device (wine_IoSetDeviceUnixPath); what is asked of
+ * the disk comes here. */
